WC-BUG-001 — Delivery Slot Selection Controls Missing or Not Clickable

Module: Buyer Checkout

Severity: Medium

Priority: high


Environment: WholeCart browser-based test environment

Test data: Buyer account; 

Preconditions

Buyer is logged in.

Cart contains products from FreshFarm Foods.

Cart net total is ₹5,968.40.

Steps to Reproduce

Log in as a buyer.

Add products to the cart.

Navigate to Checkout.

Select the current delivery date.

Click Show slots.

Observe the four displayed delivery-slot options.

Repeat the test using the next available delivery date.

Expected Result

Available delivery slots should have visible, usable selection controls.

Unavailable slots should be clearly disabled.

The buyer should be able to select a valid delivery slot and proceed with checkout.

Actual Result

Observed:

For the current delivery date, delivery-slot timings are displayed without visible, clickable radio buttons.

Checkout displays the message "Invalid delivery slot."
 the next available date allows slot selection.
 the buyer can complete checkout after selecting a slot on another date.

Business Impact

Buyers may be unable to select a delivery slot and complete checkout, potentially preventing successful purchases.
